<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Inform</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>change inform</a>
</pre>
<p>One of the settings you can switch with the change command.
</p><p>With inform on, you hear when a player joins the game: "Asta has entered the world." You only hear of players you can see. Inform is off when you start; type <a cmd='#'>change inform</a> to turn it on, and again to turn it off.
</p><p><br />
See also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Change</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Who</a>
</pre>




</div>